      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Each level is a dependent memory load, so one TLB miss can cost four loads.",
      "narration": "Each level is a dependent load, so a miss can cost four. Paging-structure caches and huge pages trim that cost.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Why walks are expensive",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
